menu "STEF Self-Test Configuration"

    config STEF_WS2812_GPIO
        int "Onboard WS2812 LED GPIO number"
        range 0 48
        default 48
        help
            GPIO driving the onboard addressable (WS2812) LED used by the
            visual-confirmation self-test. 48 on ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 and most
            N16R8 clones. Set via "idf.py menuconfig" if your board differs.

endmenu
